WEBVTT

00:07:26.823 --> 00:07:30.522
what doctors call
"the global tobacco epidemic,"

00:07:30.546 --> 00:07:34.664
we need every sector of society
to stand side by side

00:07:34.688 --> 00:07:36.555
and be part of the solution.

00:07:37.385 --> 00:07:39.631
So I call on finance leaders

00:07:39.655 --> 00:07:43.385
to implement a framework
to deal with sensitive issues.

00:07:43.409 --> 00:07:46.749
And I call on them to uphold
global conventions.

00:07:47.307 --> 00:07:49.998
But in addition, there are business risks.

00:07:50.022 --> 00:07:54.720
Pure financial risks, associated with
being invested in the tobacco industry

00:07:54.744 --> 00:07:56.156
over the long term,

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:59.249
and I ask finance leaders
to consider them.